{"synopsis":"**Dari Artist yang mengerjakan *Noblesse!***\n\nArchimond, Sang Necromancer Terkuat yang Pernah Menebar Teror di Seluruh Benua.\n\nNyawanya melayang di ujung pedang sang pahlawan, Berkel Reinland.\n\nDan 200 tahun kemudian... ia terlahir kembali sebagai bayi dari sebuah keluarga bangsawan.\n\nKata-kata pertama yang terucap dari bibirnya:\n\n**\"Wahai para penjaga kegelapan, para kaki tangan, dan seluruh pasukanku... taatilah perintahku!\"**","alternative_title":"검술명가의 네크로맨서","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"af203802-7ebd-4350-9453-e0d55cc4590a","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"2915a283-2808-49d2-b1aa-373d85d5781c","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"58a35062-5992-429d-b0b1-8802fd921fba","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"d7564841-ff1c-438c-af93-23257a3c932d","number":"17","chapter":"17","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"9ea6068b-32ef-4637-9141-10f122005c38","number":"16","chapter":"16","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"afd1d824-c72d-4273-a0b3-5780716e95ea","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"63c43ccc-5421-4de6-b67b-7a8d36690e5a","number":"14","chapter":"14","title":"","date":"2026-06-19","released":"2026-06-19"},{"chapter_id":"1b89c0da-204f-4240-b0e3-df20c8fbe2c4","number":"13","chapter":"13","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"eb9f63f5-2b42-4bfa-a3e5-345409873f28","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05"},{"chapter_id":"aefa8428-9977-4472-a92d-0674a389115f","number":"11","chapter":"11","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"3c6e363b-8b0e-4204-b42a-acd75980e272","number":"10","chapter